<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary-fixed tracking-widest uppercase">CBSE Affiliated Senior Secondary • Reg. No. 1930482</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-on-primary tracking-tight font-headline-lg leading-tight">
          Shaping Curious Minds.<br/>
<span class="italic text-secondary-container font-headline-lg">Building Future Leaders.</span>
</h1>
<p class="font-body-xl text-body-xl text-primary-fixed max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Empowering students across Grades Nursery to XII with holistic pedagogy, world-class STEM &amp; humanities infrastructure, ethical grounding, and global readiness on a 15-acre green sanctuary.
        </p>
<!-- CTA Cluster -->
<div class="pt-space-md flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md">
