<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">history_edu</span>
<span>A Quarter Century of Rigor</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold mt-1">The Vasant Kunj Heritage Campus</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary-fixed mt-1">Where classical Indian values blend harmoniously with international scientific pedagogy.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Floating Accreditation Badge -->
<div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]">military_tech</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">CBSE National</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm leading-none font-bold">Grade A1</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Column Narrative -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-space-md">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-secondary"></span>
<span>Welcome to The Heritage Academy</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-display-md text-display-md text-primary font-bold">
          Cultivating Scholarly Excellence with Unwavering Moral Purpose
        </h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          For more than 25 years, The Heritage Academy has stood as a beacon of academic eminence in the capital. Rooted in the rich cultural heritage of India while looking resolutely toward future frontiers, our institution nurtures young minds to question deeply, act ethically, and innovate courageously.
        </p>
<!-- 4 Foundational Pillars -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md pt-space-xs">
<div class="p-space-md rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container text-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">psychology</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold">Experiential Discovery</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Concept-based inquiry replacing rote memorization across all grades.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container text-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">public</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold">Global Immersion</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">International exchange, Model UN delegations, and global benchmarking.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container text-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">balance</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold">Sanskars &amp; Ethics</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Universal human values, community service, and environmental stewardship.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container text-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">memory</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold">Digital Fluency</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">AI, robotics, design thinking, and ethical computation from early years.</p>
</div>
